Route103_Text_H9_1::
	.string "Groan…$"

Route103_Text_H11::
	.string "ROUTE 103\n"
	.string "{DOWN_ARROW} OLDALE TOWN$"

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
Route103_Text_H0::
    .string "Cross the water from here and you\n"
    .string "come out right by OLDALE.\p"
    .string "You'd need a POKéMON that can\n"
    .string "SURF, of course. Fufufu.$"

Route103_Text_H1_0::
    .string "Breathe in. That's ROSELIA.\n"
    .string "Now breathe out, and battle.$"

Route103_Text_H1_1::
    .string "Your focus cut straight through\n"
    .string "the scent.$"

Route103_Text_H1_2::
    .string "Aromas are for calming the mind.\n"
    .string "Yours didn't need calming.$"

Route103_Text_H2_0::
    .string "LIV: My sister and I are one team.\n"
    .string "PLUSLE and MINUN are too!$"

Route103_Text_H2_1::
    .string "LIV: Big sister, we lost…$"

Route103_Text_H2_2::
    .string "LIV: They say KANTO's CHAMPION has\n"
    .string "a famous PIKACHU.\p"
    .string "Ours want to meet it. They've\n"
    .string "been sparking all day.$"

Route103_Text_H3_0::
    .string "AMY: I'm AMY, and this is LIV.\n"
    .string "Two of us, two sparks. Ready?$"

Route103_Text_H3_1::
    .string "AMY: Well, that was quick.$"

Route103_Text_H3_2::
    .string "AMY: Against two TRAINERS you\n"
    .string "have to watch two plans at once.\p"
    .string "You made it look easy. Rude!$"

Route103_Text_H4_0::
    .string "My line's in a knot, the fish are\n"
    .string "laughing at me, and here you are.\l"
    .string "Perfect. Battle!$"

Route103_Text_H4_1::
    .string "Knotted up again!$"

Route103_Text_H4_2::
    .string "Grr… I'll untangle this if it\n"
    .string "takes me all night.$"

Route103_Text_H5::
    .string "My POKéMON's worn out, and I didn't\n"
    .string "bring a single POTION.\p"
    .string "The MART in OLDALE sells them.\n"
    .string "I'm walking back very slowly.$"

Route103_Text_H6_0::
    .string "Mine is the most adorable POKéMON\n"
    .string "in HOENN. Look! Look closer!$"

Route103_Text_H6_1::
    .string "My darling! Are you all right?$"

Route103_Text_H6_2::
    .string "Even fainted, it's adorable.\n"
    .string "Especially fainted. It's resting.$"

Route103_Text_H7_0::
    .string "You squeezed in here too? This\n"
    .string "spot's for training in tight\l"
    .string "corners!$"

Route103_Text_H7_1::
    .string "Hah! You fight well in a box!$"

Route103_Text_H7_2::
    .string "No room to dodge, so you learn to\n"
    .string "take the hit. Try it some time.$"

Route103_Text_H8_0::
    .string "Came for the music?\n"
    .string "Stay for the battle!$"

Route103_Text_H8_1::
    .string "And that's the end of my set…$"

Route103_Text_H8_2::
    .string "I play out here where nobody comes,\n"
    .string "and still a crowd turns up.\p"
    .string "Maybe I should start charging.$"

Route103_Text_H9_0::
    .string "Look out! I can't stop!\n"
    .string "I can't steer, either!$"

Route103_Text_H9_2::
    .string "I'm practising for the long swim\n"
    .string "to OLDALE. Sorry for nearly\l"
    .string "running you over.$"

Route103_Text_H10_0::
    .string "Walk all the way round? Just swim\n"
    .string "it! It's hardly any distance!$"

Route103_Text_H10_1::
    .string "Now that's good going!$"

Route103_Text_H10_2::
    .string "With POKéMON that strong, I'd SURF\n"
    .string "everywhere too. Can't blame you.$"

Route103_Text_MayIntro::
    .string "Hm? Oh! You're the one Dad called\n"
    .string "about!\p"
    .string "I'm MAY. PROF. BIRCH is my dad.\n"
    .string "He said KANTO's CHAMPION got him\l"
    .string "away from a POOCHYENA.\p"
    .string "He also said he gave you his\n"
    .string "TORCHIC. He never let ME near\l"
    .string "that TORCHIC!\p"
    .string "I'm meant to be surveying this\n"
    .string "route. But a battle counts as\l"
    .string "fieldwork, doesn't it?$"

Route103_Text_MayPikachu::
    .string "And keep that PIKACHU away from\n"
    .string "my PELIPPER. I mean it!$"

Route103_Text_MayBattleIntro::
    .string "Okay! Show me what KANTO's got!$"

Route103_Text_MayDefeat::
    .string "So that's what a CHAMPION looks\n"
    .string "like up close…$"

Route103_Text_MayPostBattle::
    .string "My SWAMPERT started out as a\n"
    .string "MUDKIP from Dad's LAB. We've been\l"
    .string "all over HOENN together.\p"
    .string "Well. All over this end of it.\p"
    .string "I'm heading back to the LAB to\n"
    .string "tell Dad. Then I'm going farther\l"
    .string "out, and I'll be a lot stronger!\p"
    .string "Next time, it'll be far from\n"
    .string "LITTLEROOT. See you!$"

Route103_Text_BrendanIntro::
    .string "…You're not from around here.\p"
    .string "Oh. You're the CHAMPION my dad\n"
    .string "won't stop talking about.\p"
    .string "I'm BRENDAN. Thanks for getting him\n"
    .string "away from that POOCHYENA. Again.\p"
    .string "He gave you the TORCHIC, huh. He\n"
    .string "raised that one for months. Never\l"
    .string "let me near it.\p"
    .string "I'm meant to be counting POKéMON\n"
    .string "on this route. You're more\l"
    .string "interesting.$"

Route103_Text_BrendanPikachu::
    .string "Your PIKACHU's already staring at\n"
    .string "my PELIPPER. …Rude.$"

Route103_Text_BrendanBattleIntro::
    .string "Don't hold back. I'll know.$"

Route103_Text_BrendanDefeat::
    .string "…Right. So that's the gap.$"

Route103_Text_BrendanPostBattle::
    .string "SWAMPERT started out as a MUDKIP\n"
    .string "from Dad's LAB. We've walked every\l"
    .string "route around here.\p"
    .string "It's not enough. I'll report back\n"
    .string "to Dad, then I'm heading farther\l"
    .string "out.\p"
    .string "Next time you see me, it won't be\n"
    .string "anywhere near LITTLEROOT.\l"
    .string "And it won't go like this.$"
@ END PATCH
